lbx           offset  chars  case   text
DEMO.LBX      00110      66  UPPER  PRESS TO VIEW A COMPLETE REPORT ON ALL PLANETS UNDER YOUR CONTROL.
DEMO.LBX      0016B      63  UPPER  PRESS TO GET AN EXPLODED VIEW OF THE PLANET AND ORBITING SHIPS.
DEMO.LBX      001C3     132  UPPER  PRESS TO CHANGE THE SHIP CURRENTLY BEING PRODUCED IN THE STAR SYSTEM'S STAR DOCK ONCE YOU HAVE DESIGNED MORE THAN ONE CLASS OF SHIP.
DEMO.LBX      00260      19  UPPER  SHIP BUILDING RATIO
DEMO.LBX      0028C      13  UPPER  DEFENSE RATIO
DEMO.LBX      002B2      14  UPPER  INDUSTRY RATIO
DEMO.LBX      002D9      13  UPPER  ECOLOGY RATIO
DEMO.LBX      002FF      16  UPPER  TECHNOLOGY RATIO
DEMO.LBX      00328     197  UPPER  EACH STAR SYSTEM DIVIDES THEIR TOTAL PRODUCTION INTO FIVE AREAS: SHIPS, DEFENSE, INDUSTRY, ECOLOGY, AND TECH. PRESSING THE ON THE RATIO BAR ADJUSTS THE DIVISION. PRESS ON THE TITLE LOCKS THE RATIO.
DEMO.LBX      00406     190  UPPER  WHEN THE GAME FIRST BEGINS, YOU SHOULD CONCENTRATE ON BUILDING FACTORIES. TECHNOLOGY AND DEFENSE ARE TOO EXPENSIVE TO DEVELOP AND SHIPS ARE NOT NEEDED UNTIL YOU ARE READY TO BEGIN EXPANDING.
DEMO.LBX      004DD      43  UPPER  DESIGN SHIPS TO TAKE ADVANTAGE OF NEW TECH.
DEMO.LBX      00521     145  UPPER  OVERVIEW SCREEN. CHANGE TECHNOLOGY, TRADING, TRIBUTE, SABOTAGE, AND ESPIONAGE RATIOS, AS WELL AS VIEW DIPLOMATIC RELATIONS AND MAINTENANCE COSTS.
DEMO.LBX      005CB     102  UPPER  AFTER ADJUSTING THE RATIOS FOR ALL STAR SYSTEMS UNDER YOUR CONTROL, PRESS TO ADVANCE TO THE NEXT YEAR.
DEMO.LBX      0064A      89  UPPER  RELOCATE SHIP PRODUCTION, SENDING NEWLY BUILT STAR SHIPS TO ANOTHER SYSTEM AUTOMATICALLY.
DEMO.LBX      006BC      85  UPPER  VIEW ALL SHIPS UNDER YOUR CONTROL, INCLUDING THE TOTAL NUMBER OF SHIPS IN YOUR FLEET.
DEMO.LBX      0072A      72  UPPER  TRANSPORT COLONISTS FROM THE CURRENT STAR SYSTEM TO ANOTHER STAR SYSTEM.
DEMO.LBX      0078B     125  UPPER  ACTUAL PRODUCTION- TAKEN FROM THE TOTAL PRODUCTION AFTER REDUCTIONS FOR TRADE, TRIBUTE, SABOTAGE, ESPIONAGE, AND MAINTENANCE.
DEMO.LBX      00821      84  UPPER  TOTAL PRODUCTION- INCLUDES PRODUCTION FROM COLONISTS, FACTORIES, AND TRADE REVENUES.
DEMO.LBX      0088E      23  UPPER  STAR SYSTEM ENVIRONMENT
DEMO.LBX      008BE      16  UPPER  TOTAL POPULATION
DEMO.LBX      008E7     105  UPPER  MAXIMUM POPULATION THAT CAN FIT ON THE PLANET: PLANET'S BASE SIZE MINUS ANY ACCUMULATED INDUSTRIAL WASTE.
DEMO.LBX      00989     148  UPPER  NOW THAT YOUR POPULATION HAS GROWN LARGE ENOUGH, YOU SHOULD BUILD AT LEAST ONE SHIP TO SCOUT THE NEARBY STAR SYSTEMS FOR POTENTIAL NEW COLONY SITES.
DEMO.LBX      00A56     150  UPPER  NOW THAT YOUR HOME PLANET HAS A SUBSTANTIAL POPULATION AND INDUSTRY, YOU SHOULD BEGIN INVESTING RESOURCES INTO BUILDING MISSILE BASES (DEFENSE RATIO).
DEMO.LBX      00B25     146  UPPER  NOW THAT YOU HAVE MADE CONTACT WITH ANOTHER RACE, YOU CAN SHOULD BEGIN TO DEVOTE RESOURCES TO TRADE TO IMPROVE RELATIONS AND INCREASE YOUR INCOME.
DEMO.LBX      00BF0     155  UPPER  AS TECHNOLOGY ADVANCES YOU SHOULD BE SURE TO DISMISS OBSOLETE SHIPS. SHIPS THAT ARE 10 OR MORE LEVELS BEHIND EXISTING ENEMY TECHNOLOGY ARE NEXT TO USELESS.
DEMO.LBX      00CC4     126  UPPER  TO STAY COMPETITIVE WITH YOUR ENEMIES, YOU MUST NOT FALL BEHIND IN THE TECHNOLOGY RACE, ESPECIALLY WITH WEAPONS AND COMPUTERS.
DEMO.LBX      00D7B     157  UPPER  NOW THAT YOU HAVE DEVELOPED A WEAPON BETTER THAN A LASER, YOU SHOULD DESIGN A NEW SHIP THAT WILL REPLACE THE STARTING SCOUT AND USES THE BETTER WEAPONS TECH.
DEMO.LBX      00E51     162  UPPER  NOW THAT YOU HAVE FOUND A STAR SYSTEM SUITABLE FOR COLONIZATION BEGIN TRANSPORTING COLONISTS BECAUSE ALL PLANETS HAVE A MAXIMUM POPULATION WHICH CAN BE SUPPORTED.
DEMO.LBX      00F2C     160  UPPER  ALTHOUGH YOU HAVE DISCOVERED A STAR SYSTEM THAT YOU CAN NOT YET LAND ON, YOU CAN STILL REACH OTHER STAR SYSTEMS BY PLACING A SHIP IN ORBIT WITH REFUELING TANKS.
DEMO.LBX      01005     192  UPPER  WITH THE INCREASED GROWTH OF YOUR INDUSTRY, WASTE REDUCTION WILL BEGIN COSTING AN INCREASED PERCENTAGE OF YOU PRODUCTION. REDUCE THE AMOUNT OF WASTE WITH CONSTRUCTION AND PLANETOLOGY RESEARCH.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  004D7      98  Mixed  <  Hail emperor ~. The ^ empire genuinely thanks you for your generous tribute in difficult times.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0053A     123  Title    Many in the ^s have looked to the % empire with great distrust, but your tribute has now won over the conviction of many.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  005B6      85  Title    Your tribute has been accepted as reparations for your crimes against the ^ empire.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0060C     124  Title    Our request for assistance was handsomely met by your empire and will go a long way toward improving our mutual relations.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00689     147  Title    Diplomatic channels between the % and ^ empires have been tenuous at best, but your tribute now offers a way to significantly reduce the tension.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0071D      89  Title    Emperor ~, the ^ empire applauds your generous tribute and welcomes future cooperation.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00777      80  Title    You have made a wise choice in offering tribute to an obviously superior race.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  007C8      85  Title    The ^ empire greatly appreciates your support with such a magnanimous contribution.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0081E      87  Title    Emperor ~, your generous tribute has laid many ^ grievances with your empire to rest.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00876     133  Title    Emperor ~, your magnificent contribution will go far toward establishing a lasting peace and a hopeful future for both our peoples.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  008FC     101  Title    With tribute such as this, both our empires will soon be able to exist together in perfect harmony.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00962     106  Title    Your contributions to establish mutual trade between our two empires has greatly enhanced our relations.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  009CD      83  Title    The trade between the % and ^ empires has greatly relaxed current tension levels.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00A21     148  Title    Emperor ~, the trade between our two empires has not only increased our production but has also formed a basis for mutual respect and cooperation.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00AB6     132  Title    The prosperous trade between our two empires has formed a solid financial foundation from which both our empires can benefit from.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00B3B     119  Title    Although our empires have had disagreements in the past, mutual trade has certainly some of the relieved the tension.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00BB3     126  Title    Continued trade between the % and ^ empires is of extreme importance if both our empires are to resist the threat of others.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00C32      92  Title    The trade you offered has given our two empires an opportunity to strengthen our alliance.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00C8F     137  Title    The prosperous trade between the % and ^ empires has provided excellent incentives to maintain a lasting peace between our two empires.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00D19      78  Title    The % trade has marked a new era of cooperation between the % and ^ empires.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00D68      93  Mixed    Watch yourself emperor ~. We will no longer tolerate espionage attempts against our empire.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00DC6      94  Title    We have known of your espionage operations for quite some time, and our patience wears thin.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00E25     133  Title    We have had great restraint thus far tolerating your bungling espionage attempts, but soon you will feel the wrath of the ^ empire.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00EAB      76  Title    The ^ empire is compelled to protest your persistent * espionage attempts.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00EF8     142  Mixed    Obviously you have underestimated our patience in dealing with * espionage. If you continue it will most certainly lead to open hostilities.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  00F87     102  Title    Your * espionage attempts are creating an unwarranted amount of tension between the % and ^ empires.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  012B6     154  Title    In the past the ^ empire has been kind to inferior species, but if you persist in the sabotage of our & we will eliminate the % threat once and for all.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01351     108  Title    Surely emperor ~, you must realize that sabotage at any level will surely jeopardize any future relations.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  013BE     131  Title    Your cunningly contrived plan to sabotage ^ & in the @ star system has placed our empires precariously close to the brink of war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01442      82  Title    Continue to sabotage our & and you will plunge us into a foolish and costly war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01495     131  Mixed    Emperor ~, hear this. Discontinue any further attempts of sabotage against the ^ empire or face the consequences of your actions.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01519      89  Title    Your bungling attempts to sabotage our & is shattering what little peace we still have.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01573     113  Mixed    The ^ empire will not stand for acts of terrorism such as the sabotage attempt at @. Wars have begun over less.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  015E5     137  Title    Emperor ~, if you wish to avert a senseless war you will immediately discontinue all sabotage operations launched against the ^ empire.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01AC6     102  Mixed    Too many of % ships have been amassing along our border. Remove the ships or face the perils of war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01B2D     124  Mixed    Do you take me for a complete moron. The buildup up of ships along our border can only be interpreted as a prelude to war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01BAA     116  Mixed    Doubtless you disbelieve our conviction. Continue to amass star ships along our border and soon we will be at war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01C1F     116  Mixed    Despite our warnings, % star ships have been seen moving through ^ territory. Continue and they will be destroyed.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01C94     105  Title    Unless you reduce the number % of ships along our border, we will be forced to take preemptive actions.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01CFE     107  Mixed    The % empire has grown far too large. Continue to expand and we will be forced to take militant measures.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01D6A     108  Mixed    Your reckless expansion is beginning to intrude upon ^ territory. Withdraw from our space or be destroyed.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01DD7     133  Mixed    Your ambitious expansion cannot remain unchecked. Unless you begin to withdraw we will be forced to reclaim our territory by force.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01E5D      76  Title    Cease your expansion into ^ territory or we will crush your pathetic race.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01EAA      69  Title    Together our empires can challenge the threat of the evil = empire.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  01EF0      74  Title    Your attacking the insidious = proves the honor in your words of peace .
