DIPLOMAC.LBX  021D9      87  Title    In the future make it a point to stay out of ^ space, or you will be crushed utterly.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02231     101  Title    The ^s order you to cease all hostilities in the @ system or face the consequences of your actions.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02297     137  Mixed    % star ships have engaged in unlawful penetration of ^ territory. You will discontinue such operations or suffer immediate retaliation.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02321     102  Title    The ^s order you to immediately remove all vessels from the @ star system or they will be destroyed.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02388     132  Mixed    We are not fools. Surely you do not expect us to believe that the attack on the @ star system was initiated by renegade activists.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0240D      94  Title    Conflicts such as the battle at @ can only be interpreted as a prelude to expansion and war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0246C     127  Mixed    Emperor ~ you can not simply attack ^ starships with impunity. Even as I speak, the ^ empire is preparing for full scale war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  024EC     120  Title    Emperor ~, if you wish to avoid a pointless war between our two peoples, you must stop randomly attacking ^ starships.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02565     128  Title    Consider yourself fortunate emperor ~ that the ^ empire is not yet ready to enter into a senseless war over the incident at @.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  025E6      88  Title    Peace talks will soon break down if the % empire does not cease attacking ^ starships.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  0263F     136  Mixed    The relations between our two empires is becoming quite dire. The attack on the @ star system was unprovoked and may soon lead to war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  026C8     120  Mixed    Attacking our colony at @ was quite unwise. The ^ empire will no longer sit idle while our people are slain by % dogs.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02741     113  Mixed    Emperor ~, % star ships have invaded and violated ^ space. Such actions can only be construed as an act or war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  027B3     126  Title    Whereas the destruction of our ships can be endured, the wholesale slaughtering of ^ colonists will certainly guarantee war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02832      99  Title    The ruthless storming of the @ colony has destroyed whatever future our two empires may have had.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02896      95  Title    Venture near the @ star system again and we will be forced to annihilate the entire % empire.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  028F6      68  Title    How can you not expect retaliation for the unprovoked attack at @.
