DIPLOMAC.LBX  029A1      85  Title    The ^ empire considers the attack on the @ star system as an unprovoked act of war.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  029F7     143  Mixed    Emperor ~, you will pay dearly for blatantly disregarding ^ space and attacking the outpost at @. Soon you will pay dearly for your misdeeds.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02A87     115  Mixed    Blast you emperor ~. You are jeopardizing the future of both our peoples by your senseless attacks on ^ colonies.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02AFB     104  Mixed    How dare you enter ^ space and attack one of our colonies. Such audacity can only be answered in kind.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02B64     100  Title    Emperor ~, simple rhetoric will not excuse you from using biological weapons in the @ star system.
