DIPLOMAC.LBX  02D7A     134  Mixed    Obviously the % is ran by a madman willing to use biological weapons at any whim. Soon the ^ empire will put an end to your madness.
DIPLOMAC.LBX  02E01      77  Mixed    Your interference has been tolerated long enough. This of course means war!
